msgid "Ryuuji「Wiles? Ohh, \"wild\"? It's true Taiga＿operates by some kind of wild instinct,＿but I don't think that's to blame for」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Salva? Ah, \"salvaje\". Es cierto que＿Taiga se guía por un instinto salvaje,＿pero no creo que eso sea la causa de」"

msgid "Ryuuji「this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If she's implying something, then I＿don't get it...... Don't tell me, she's not＿gonna plan the test of courage herself,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si insinúa algo, no lo entiendo......＿No me digas que va a organizar ella＿misma la prueba de valor,」"

